      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SUNDAY STROLLER (8) caught the eye when clocking a flying 23.65 over 407m at this track three back then has hit the frame in both runs since. Hard to top on best recent times. SUPER SEAPLANE (6) produced a modest effort most recently when seventh at this track over 407m behind Cowboy's Rodeo (24.53) in a Grade 4/5. Some good form is emerging from his last run. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. BEST EDITION (2) missed the hat-trick last start when eighth and beaten 61 lengths (33.97) last time at Q Parklands. Has a good record at this journey. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Likely to be thereabouts. SHINY INTENTION (7) racing over this course and distance brings the best out in her.",
